WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.022
Read the map from the core upward.

2
00:00:02.022 --> 00:00:15.527
Read the scale map from bottom to top: hypersphere core; excitations and moiré-like modes; Standard Model particles; atoms and the periodic table; molecules; planets and stars; and cosmic structure.

3
00:00:15.527 --> 00:00:20.230
The Standard Model occupies one slice in this broader BHSM picture.

4
00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:26.171
The core is a proposed foundation without an assigned ordinary diameter or internal travel time.

5
00:00:26.171 --> 00:00:33.452
The slices organize ideas across scales, while the moiré pattern illustrates the proposed organization of modes.

6
00:00:33.452 --> 00:00:36.841
Select each slice to see its meaning and evidence status.

7
00:00:36.841 --> 00:00:40.862
Each connection still needs its own physical explanation and tests.

8
00:00:40.862 --> 00:00:45.656
Notice where the labels change from BHSM proposal to established science.
